 r←Connect ns
⍝ Jarvis calls this when a client opens a WebSocket connection
⍝ ns - the connection's namespace: ns.conx is the connection's name, ns.Server is the Jarvis server
⍝ r  - 0 to accept the connection (anything else closes it)
⍝ Record the connection's name in Clients, so that Receive can send messages to everyone
